{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-03",
  "title": "鸣铳示警",
  "storyCode": "10-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6bf754e1b26963ff4c8df19781bc23a3c4405b3c5ba28cbb69c58d4f8e6e742d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "9:27 A.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆，萨迪恩区，高墙之上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三零九号出入口发生骚乱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......报告将军，巡逻队发现反抗军踪迹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不止反抗军！巡逻队正与多方同时交火——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "将军，是否派人支援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "进度如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大概还要一刻钟左右才能调试好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "八分钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在八分钟之内准备好。情况不容许我们拖太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用我下去看看？当然，只是一个建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你担心我会失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么会呢？你的计算从未失准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我的工作，是确保我们通往胜利的道路上少一些变数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么你已经做得足够好了，雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来吧，站到这边来。在试验正式开始之前，我需要让你也看看这高墙下的局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很热闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "与卡兹戴尔的战场相比，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不算新鲜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过......至少交手双方并不都是萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在卡兹戴尔的时候，应该也猎过兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "猎兽？对常年身处野外的雇佣兵来说，这也算是填饱肚子的必要选项。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你一定知道，为何我要留下这些出入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有的时候，陷阱虽然显眼，但因为处在必经之路上，野兽们还是会一个接着一个地踩上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是找不到出路，它们反而会到处乱窜，让我们不得不分散人力去围追堵截。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，这是荒地里的法则，但不止如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看我们脚下的这座城市。它大到就像钢铁丛生的荒野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁有自信能封住一片荒野上的全部出路？谁又能找出丛林中每一处视野边缘的缝隙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不会这般自负。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你选择留下几个缺口，集中注意，等着敌人自己冒出来。这是效率最高的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可也有一定风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不冒险的话，怎么会有收获？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "换作是我，我也会这么选。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。出色的雇佣兵头领，也一定是优秀的猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比起那些王庭遗老，我更喜欢和你一起并肩作战，而这就是原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......看起来，你今天收获颇丰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了反抗军，还有深池......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，我见过那个术师，她来见过你。你们不是达成停战约定了吗？虽然可能你们都没太把这当回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你见过她，你就该知道，那样的人，从来不清楚自己该在何时停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你早就想排除掉这个搅局者了，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事态在变化。殿下的工程接近尾声，场面太乱的话，容易漏掉一些真正的威胁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们需要把精力更多地放在外面那些大公爵身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你不如直接派我下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是除掉她的话，用不着你动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有其他顾虑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那位“威灵顿的铁卫”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他尚未带人靠近伦蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而只要他一天不表态，伦蒂尼姆外的那些贵族，每天早上第一件事，就一定是询问自己的密使，铁公爵有没有发言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我们还不能与深池明面交恶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，要是她耐不住了，主动做什么撕毁约定的事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨卡兹也绝没有继续容忍他们的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那下面发生的冲突确实还不够。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，我们还需要一些......真正能把深池解决掉的把柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这些突然冒出来的是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道......长官，他们的武器和源石技艺我们都没见过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们也在和萨卡兹交战......不是魔族佬的援军？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管了，谁碍事我们就除掉谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乖乖把人还回来吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是......是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哟，熟人？看来你早上挨的揍还不够狠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "注意后面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "战场上的敌人不会站在你面前任由你挥拳头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是还有你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "克制一些。比起把敌人揍得鼻青脸肿，我们更优先的任务是救人，然后撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就拳头挥得更快一点呗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是说......他们就是刚刚从我们手里抢人的那伙人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "记住他们的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，等等......看看能不能抓一个活的回去。不管伦蒂尼姆里混进来了什么新的势力，领袖都会感兴趣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......怎么突然有石头冒出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小心一些，我们还没踏入高墙，博士不想看见有人受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的......你们也是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......一锤子把我的造物砸碎了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这家伙......和维多利亚士兵一样可恶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然我也没使什么力......尝尝这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "推进之王，闪开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#4$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......有人替我打掉了威胁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "白轮，你看到是谁了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有，太乱了，我看不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米娅，战场上还有别的人在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了我们、深池还有萨卡兹以外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#10$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，他们看起来并不是敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "长官，战况对我们不太有利......您能不能让这面墙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这面墙......呵......我倒是幻想过很多次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，真到了那一天，领袖来了，我们不是没有机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在还不是说这些胡话的时候，我们必须再忍耐一段时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们也听着些，动起手来收敛些，不要留什么破绽，我不想让那个叫曼弗雷德的魔族佬提前来找我们麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四分钟。我们还要再等四分钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，我们的战士也还没尽兴。要守住一座像伦蒂尼姆这样的城市，和在荒郊野岭打劫拉特兰商队相比，算得上天差地别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熟人相会，还不用担心对方是不是随时惦记着自己的脑袋，我可没资格抱怨这生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别把你自己和他们混为一谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没几个雇佣兵会和你一样，能忍受那种被关在小院子里天天看书的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我记得你把我捞出来，并且把剑还给我的时候，我是说了谢谢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，我让你帮我，不是为了听你说这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你需要雇佣兵，而且不是借一两次力量那种需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......而你是其中最出色的那一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正好，最近又有几支雇佣兵军团加入了我们，里面有几位还是你在疤痕商场的老熟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "摄政王开的价码，很少有雇佣兵能够拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们所图的已不仅仅是完成一两个合同之后能换取的一点奖赏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们跟随着摄政王离开卡兹戴尔的时候，每一位战士所持的武器都不一样，有的人穿着的盔甲上一秒还穿在敌人身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而现在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也看见了，伦蒂尼姆的工厂日夜不停地在为我们生产防具与武器。我们的部队有了新的规制，接受统一的号令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们正前所未有地团结，而这份团结使我们比以往更强大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，整个维多利亚......不，整个泰拉都看在眼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这都在摄政王的计算之内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在一年之前，他们还可笑地以为伦蒂尼姆的军队是如何坚不可摧，他们以为我们只是服务于某一位公爵的雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当雇佣兵信奉的不再只有利益......他们都会看见我们萨卡兹能做到什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不再效忠于利益的雇佣兵，还是雇佣兵吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们并未要求这些同胞彻底抛下雇佣兵的身份，是他们找到了追随摄政王的其他理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们相信摄政王正在改变萨卡兹的生活，除了居无定所的劫掠者与为他族权势者服务的工具之外，萨卡兹有机会为自己挣来新的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......只有有家的人，才有身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“当萨卡兹渴望战争时，萨卡兹即战争本身——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“——而在每一场战争结束后，萨卡兹亦有家可归。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是摄政王对所有在伦蒂尼姆的萨卡兹说的话，当时你也在觐见之列。那是我们第一次会面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那一天，我就问过你对这句话的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“只要是从卡兹戴尔的废墟中爬出来的战士，谁能拒绝这样的愿景？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我上次听见这个回答，还是三年前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今你已经从那座宅邸里走了出来，站到了我的身侧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的想法......依旧不变？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曼弗雷德，你已经得到了我的效忠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的左眼，还疼吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一年过去，早就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......希望你明白。自从那一天起，我就从未怀疑我们之间的友谊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你知道我指的是什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......赦罪师们不会放下对任何一名雇佣兵的戒心。这是他们为摄政王效力的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_393_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我......我的工作不会是为了向某些人证明自己的忠心，这只会成为我在战场上拔剑的阻碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你的答案依旧是“不”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这也不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有时候我也更需要一位朋友，为此，卡兹戴尔可以忍受暂时少一位校官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "将军，准备好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "传令巡逻队，立刻撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "启动自动瞄准系统，输入远程打击目标——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——坐标，萨迪恩区，三零九号出入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们过去几个月的努力终于要见到结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫德雷，你想按下启动键吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中尉，深池看起来快要赢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不是深池要赢了，但这不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别管他们谁输谁赢，重要的是他们彼此牵制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是我们需要的局面，一个能让你们冲到前面去的局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冲到前面去......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，趁他们没办法把注意力放在我们身上。这是你们逃出城的好时机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，罗本？你在想什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中尉，我不想走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要留下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这可能是你们撤离伦蒂尼姆的唯一机会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天发生了这场混战，明天这扇门就会被萨卡兹堵上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把你们的武器藏起来，混在前面那些奔逃躲避的平民里！走，往前走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我们不该就这样逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中尉，我们还可以战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您看见了吗？我刚才射倒了一个深池士兵！我还伤到了两个萨卡兹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这把弩......很粗糙，与我们惯常使用的制式军弩完全不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是您做的，是吗？您连武器都需要亲手来做，难道不需要更多一起奋战的战友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是我需不需要的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们不愿意这就走，我也不会强迫你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不想再下令让一个不愿意离开的士兵离开战场了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中尉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先不说这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们必须马上离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最好的时机只有此刻，你们不想往前走，那好，我们一起后撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，萨卡兹士兵们在离开战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本来就有些奇怪，他们竟然跟我们还有深池混战了这么久，却既没有派来援军，也没有对深池赶尽杀绝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不像我熟悉的萨卡兹战士的作战风格，就连W带去整合运动的雇佣兵都比他们打得用心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "很不对劲。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，我们是不是掉进陷阱了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这场冲突，来得又巧合又突然......就好像，有人想把我们都聚在一起，然后......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃，这陷阱真的是为我们准备的吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "推进之王小姐说，她在战场上发现了其他人，他们也和我们一样，混在人堆里......而且看起来也站在平民一边。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们会不会才是萨卡兹士兵在抓捕的对象？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "作战干员马上撤出交战区。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "侦察小组，掩护作战干员和平民撤退。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "所有人，就近找掩体准备撤离！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......博士下令撤退了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊？我们马上就能把人都救完了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士一定有自己的判断。我们走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......啧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "女士，因陀罗女士！我、我在这里——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "托马斯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推进之王",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别过去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "火光在一瞬间填满了每个人的视野。\n滚烫的热流几乎熔化了所有能触及到的物体。\n没有太多完整的碎片飞出来，但剧烈的震动提醒着幸存者们，自己刚才距离死亡只有一步之遥。\n而这威胁正来自头顶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......怎么回事？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有人从空中丢炸弹下来？这地面上......突然就......炸开了这么大的坑？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "托马斯......咳咳，烟这么大，什么都看不见啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "达格达",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "因陀罗！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "达格达",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你听见了，推进之王让你停下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerToken": "avg_155_tiger_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好吧，你又救了我一次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "达格达",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "知道就行了，赶紧走——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
